    {
      "id": "A1-10-l2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "always / usually / sometimes / never",
      "est_minutes": 30,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "**ظروف التكرار** تقول **كم مرة** نفعل الشيء. نستخدمها مع المضارع البسيط."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "الكلمة",
            "المعنى",
            "النسبة",
            "مثال"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "always",
              "دائماً",
              "100%",
              "It's always hot in Aden in summer."
            ],
            [
              "usually",
              "عادةً",
              "80%",
              "I usually walk to school."
            ],
            [
              "often",
              "غالباً / كثيراً",
              "60%",
              "It often rains in Ibb in August."
            ],
            [
              "sometimes",
              "أحياناً",
              "40%",
              "It's sometimes windy in Mukalla."
            ],
            [
              "never",
              "أبداً / لا … أبداً",
              "0%",
              "It never snows in Aden."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "**مكانها في الجملة:**\n\n- **قبل** الفعل العادي: I **always** get up early. / She **never** drinks coffee.\n- **بعد** فعل be (am / is / are): It **is often** cold in Sana'a. / They **are never** late.\n\n**انتبه:** never معناها النفي، فلا نضع معها not: ✗ I don't never… ← ✓ I **never**…\n\n**السؤال عن الطقس:** What's the weather like today? ← It's sunny and hot. It's 30 degrees."
        },
