          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "Good evening. Here is the weather for tomorrow, Tuesday. In Sana'a, it will be sunny in the morning but cold at night, about eight degrees. Take a jacket. In Aden, it will be very hot, thirty-six degrees, and windy near the sea. In Ibb, it will be cloudy and rainy in the afternoon. Don't forget your umbrella. In Mukalla, it will be sunny and hot, thirty-four degrees. That's all for tonight. Good night."
